- Refined vertical distance calculation—more accurate ascent/descent based on your feedback.

### Navigation & UI Tweaks
- Improved navigation mode—bottom panels no longer obscure your location arrow.
- Automatic compass off when speed exceeds 3 km/h (down from 5 km/h) for smoother tracking.

### Smarter Markers
- Enhanced “add marker here”—markers dropped at your current position now auto-include location accuracy and its distance/time from trip start in the description.
Enjoy the faster search, more precise metrics, and cleaner navigation experience!
