### Performance
- Faster trip loading — optimized handling for routes with a large number of markers.

### Statistics
- Improved algorithms — refined calculations for speed, elevation and other metrics.
Tip: To apply the updates to existing routes, export them as GPX/KML and then re-import.

### Recording Precision
- Higher-resolution distance triggers — now choose minimum recording distances of 50 cm, 10 cm, or 1 cm in your custom profile.

